{
 "voice": "af_heart",
 "sample_rate": 24000,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "S01",
   "text": "You've been shrunk smaller than a blood cell... and your own body is about to attack you.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.439,
   "delivery": "hook",
   "speed": 0.93
  },
  {
   "id": "S02",
   "text": "That squishy cushion under you? One red blood cell.",
   "start": 4.739,
   "end": 7.595,
   "delivery": "curious",
   "speed": 0.97
  },
  {
   "id": "S03",
   "text": "A single drop of your blood holds millions of them.",
   "start": 7.745,
   "end": 10.56,
   "delivery": "calm",
   "speed": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "S04",
   "text": "Hear that thumping? That's your heart... and you're heading straight in.",
   "start": 10.91,
   "end": 14.136,
   "delivery": "suspense",
   "speed": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "S05",
   "text": "Every beat, the valves behind you slam shut. That lub-dub? That's them closing.",
   "start": 14.436,
   "end": 19.038,
   "delivery": "dramatic",
   "speed": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "S06",
   "text": "One squeeze fires you into your lungs... into tunnels so tight, blood cells barely squeeze through.",
   "start": 19.338,
   "end": 24.584,
   "delivery": "urgent",
   "speed": 1.06
  },
  {
   "id": "S07",
   "text": "And through a wall over a hundred times thinner than paper, oxygen floods in... and carbon dioxide drifts out. That's the air you breathe out.",
   "start": 24.834,
   "end": 33.048,
   "delivery": "excited",
   "speed": 1.04
  },
  {
   "id": "S08",
   "text": "Then... something notices you.",
   "start": 33.498,
   "end": 35.251,
   "delivery": "suspense",
   "speed": 0.88
  },
  {
   "id": "S09",
   "text": "A neutrophil. Your body's first responder. To it, you're not you... you're an intruder. And it swallows intruders whole.",
   "start": 35.851,
   "end": 42.609,
   "delivery": "dramatic",
   "speed": 0.97
  },
  {
   "id": "S10",
   "text": "You kick free... barely.",
   "start": 42.859,
   "end": 44.345,
   "delivery": "urgent",
   "speed": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "S11",
   "text": "The current drags you back to your heart, and its main pump launches you into the biggest artery you have!",
   "start": 44.495,
   "end": 49.653,
   "delivery": "urgent",
   "speed": 1.08
  },
  {
   "id": "S12",
   "text": "You survived. But somewhere in your lungs... a white blood cell is still trying to digest your shoe.",
   "start": 50.203,
   "end": 55.663,
   "delivery": "humor",
   "speed": 0.98
  }
 ],
